{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_087_1000_047sub", "source_sha256": "e1de0738dfdd03d8dfef976f56fa5a0f64c86e3a1300375319dcdb4b55730c82", "ja": "なあ、可憐。さっきから\nスマホメッチャ鳴ってるけど、\nどうしたんだ？　迷惑メール？", "zh": "喂，可怜。你的手机从刚才起就一直响个不停，怎么了？是垃圾短信？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_087_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "04bdbfb72fc33640d4bfa6743e62e078de8ded01785057bb8a15bce03a1fe228", "ja": "あ、ち、違うよ……お母さん。\n帰りが遅くなるなら、お父さんが\n迎えに行くからって、何度も……。", "zh": "啊，不、不是的……是妈妈。\n她说要是回去晚了，爸爸会去接她，所以一直发消息过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_087_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "fa660298feb48e97c278c62c3c7c019c7ced3510921d8dab04d1ce858b23ef0e", "ja": "可憐のご両親って、\nとっても優しいんだね！", "zh": "可怜的爸爸妈妈，\n真的很温柔呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_087_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "9eeef4a575651409bee0e39726f1c91b7825f6cf7b87bf1c5416b20dbd668e4c", "ja": "は、はい……けどちょっと\n過保護すぎるっていうか……。\n極端なところが、あって。", "zh": "是、是的……不过该说是有点\n过度保护了……有些地方，确实比较极端。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_087_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "e45c098fe5478d611c3fd867a02c6c2c72dedded1397685560546eb13e80fb96", "ja": "過保護かぁ……それって、\nすっげー心配性って感じ？", "zh": "过度保护啊……那就是特别爱操心的意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_087_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_087_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "e4ec61896648800eff048a4d53ce1e4645a00b1113d9318761a596e067bb9790", "ja": "う、うん……。\n昔から、そうなんだ。\n私がひとりっ子だからかな……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……\n从以前开始，就是这样了。\n大概是因为我是独生女吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
